1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,554
Every field has a history. NASA has recorded forty-five years of it.

2
00:00:04,704 --> 00:00:07,749
Terrasight is the AI assistant that reads it for you.

3
00:00:08,049 --> 00:00:09,119
Add your field.

4
00:00:11,049 --> 00:00:15,922
It shows what changed, what to do today, and what to plant for five seasons.

5
00:00:16,449 --> 00:00:19,817
Ask it anything. Every number is checked against the models.

6
00:00:21,299 --> 00:00:23,251
And it shows you where it was wrong.

7
00:00:25,749 --> 00:00:28,998
Terrasight. The AI assistant for your farm.
